WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,820
General evil spirits and bad luck stuff

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:04,620
I don't dare to come within ten meters of this dormitory.

3
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,420
So I bring you food every day

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,220
Even ride on my fire snake fee

5
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,220
Essentially

6
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,020
I'm paying for this sleeping suit

7
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,020
And the usage fee for your body protective suit

8
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,620
Long live understanding

9
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:16,420
There is no free lunch in the world

10
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,620
An equal exchange?

11
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:22,100
Forget it, this is your overlord clause.

12
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,260
At least I haven't had any bad luck lately

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:35,830
Stayed up most of the night

14
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:36,830
What are you doing?

15
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:40,420
Why don't you go to tea and get hot water?

16
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:43,020
Bureau 749 stipulates that special evaluation consultants cannot drink water at night
